      </a>
    </div>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#EDEDEB;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">One click and you’re on the list · launch news and release notes, nothing else.</p><p style="margin:28px 0 16px;text-align:center;"><a href="https://example.test/subscribe/confirm?token=RAW_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#B03A45;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:8px;">Confirm subscription</a></p><p style="margin:16px 0 0;color:#A9A9A6;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;">This link is valid for 24 hours and can be used once. If you didn’t subscribe, ignore this email and you won’t hear from us.</p>
