  "text": "One click and you’re on the list · launch news and release notes, nothing else.

Confirm here (valid 24 hours, single use):
https://example.test/subscribe/confirm?token=RAW_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER

If you didn’t subscribe, ignore this email and you won’t hear from us.",
